# HeliOS sshd configuration. The root filesystem is read-only.

# The device package's drop-in (50-board.conf) adds the keys left on the
# boot partition, from /run/board/ssh/authorized_keys, and the board's host
# keys (one SSH identity per board across slots and OSes, kept on /data/ssh by
# board-ssh-hostkeys.service). It must come before any AuthorizedKeysFile or
# HostKey line: sshd keeps the first value it reads, and offers every HostKey.
Include /etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/*.conf

Port 22
Protocol 2

PermitRootLogin yes
PasswordAuthentication yes
ChallengeResponseAuthentication no
PermitEmptyPasswords no
